  "protocolVersion": null,
  "instructions": "Gruvi is content distribution for agents. Bring finished video content and custom thumbnails. Connect social accounts in the web dashboard, then upload, publish or schedule through these tools. Setup and read access do not require a subscription; submitting a post requires an active plan or trial. Trials last three days and are available once per account. Public posting requires the user instruction to cover the content and destination accounts. Inspect existing uploads and schedules before retrying. An accepted request is not confirmed publication. If a send times out, check delivery before retrying. TikTok defaults to draft/inbox delivery. No generation tools are exposed.",
